<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FineRS</span>: Fine-grained Reasoning and Segmentation of Small Objects with Reinforcement Learning</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
