<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Visual results on Open-ended VQA (OVQA), Multiple-choice VQA (MVQA), and Instruction-guided Segmentation (IS). The listed images are sampled from <span id="S5.F4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FineRS</span>-4k test set. </figcaption>
