<section id="A1.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>User Prompt for <span id="A1.SS5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FineRS</span></h3>

<div id="A1.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fig. <a href="#A1.F3" title="Figure A3 ‣ A.5 User Prompt for FineRS ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ FineRS: Fine-grained Reasoning and Segmentation of Small Objects with Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A3</span></a> and Fig. <a href="#A1.F4" title="Figure A4 ‣ A.5 User Prompt for FineRS ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ FineRS: Fine-grained Reasoning and Segmentation of Small Objects with Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A4</span></a> illustrate the user prompts of Global Semantic Exploration (GSE) and Localized Proceptual Refinement (LPR) modules across three tasks, including Instruction-guided Segmentation (IS), Open-ended VQA (OVQA), and Multiple-choice VQA (MVQA).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F3" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.21311v1/prompt_GSE.svg" id="A1.F3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/307;" width="476" height="307"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A3: </span>User prompt for GSE module. </figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F4" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.21311v1/Prompt_LPR.svg" id="A1.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/298;" width="476" height="298"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A4: </span>User prompt for LPR module. </figcaption>
</figure>
